### ========================================================
### PENGUJIAN RESTful API CRUD PRODUK & USER (SPRING BOOT + JWT)
### Jika di Antigravity terpasang ekstensi "REST Client", 
### kamu bisa langsung klik tombol "Send Request" di atas setiap URL.
### ========================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/products
@userUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/users
@authUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/auth

### ========================================================
### 1. AUTENTIKASI (JWT)
### ========================================================

### A1. Registrasi User Baru
# @name registerUser
POST {{authUrl}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Adib Maros",
  "email": "adib@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### A2. Login User (Default Seeder: john.doe@example.com / password123)
# @name loginUser
POST {{authUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Simpan token dari respon login di atas:
@token = {{loginUser.response.body.data.token}}

### A3. Ambil Profil User yang Sedang Login (Protected - Perlu JWT)
GET {{authUrl}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ========================================================
### 2. ENDPOINT USER (Protected - Memerlukan Token JWT)
### ========================================================

### U1. Ambil Semua Data User (beserta list produk masing-masing)
GET {{userUrl}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### U2. Ambil Detail User Berdasarkan ID
GET {{userUrl}}/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### U3. Tambah User Baru Lewat Admin
POST {{userUrl}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sarah Connor",
  "email": "sarah.connor@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "ROLE_USER"
}

### U4. Update User Berdasarkan ID
PUT {{userUrl}}/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe (Updated)",
  "email": "john.updated@example.com",
  "password": "newpassword123"
}

### U5. Hapus User Berdasarkan ID (Cascade menghapus produk miliknya)
DELETE {{userUrl}}/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ========================================================
### 3. ENDPOINT PRODUK
### ========================================================

### P1. Ambil Semua Data Produk (PUBLIC - Tanpa Login / Tanpa Token)
GET {{baseUrl}}

### P2. Ambil Data dengan Fitur Pencarian (PUBLIC)
GET {{baseUrl}}?search=macbook

### P3. Ambil Data dengan Pagination & Sorting (PUBLIC)
GET {{baseUrl}}?page=0&size=2&sortBy=price&sortDir=desc

### P4. Ambil Detail 1 Produk Berdasarkan ID (PUBLIC)
GET {{baseUrl}}/1

### P5. Tambah Produk Baru (PROTECTED - Perlu Token JWT)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Headset Sony WH-1000XM5",
  "price": 4999000.0,
  "stock": 15,
  "description": "Headphone wireless dengan noise cancelling terbaik",
  "userId": 1
}

### P6. Uji Coba Error Validasi (Nama kosong & Harga negatif)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "price": -50000.0,
  "stock": -2,
  "description": "Testing validasi gagal"
}

### P7. Update Produk Berdasarkan ID (PROTECTED - Perlu Token JWT)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Laptop Asus TUF Gaming A15 (Updated)",
  "price": 14999000.0,
  "stock": 12,
  "description": "Spesifikasi di-upgrade ke RAM 16GB",
  "userId": 1
}

### P8. Hapus Produk Berdasarkan ID (PROTECTED - Perlu Token JWT)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
